        "kind": "behavior-change",
        "exposedClass": "review-required",
        "statement": "After the upgrade, new and rewritten ImagePolicy objects are stored as v1. Existing objects stay stored as v1beta2, and the CRD's status.storedVersions still lists v1beta2. v1beta2 is still served in this release, so nothing fails. Before any future release that stops serving v1beta2, the stored objects would need migrating.",
